  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math><br /><math><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math><br />Total number of <math><mn>1</mn></math> in matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
